/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Across the 2,768 respondents, the Cleveland music ecosystem enjoys a healthy balance across creatives \(74%\), industry \(18%\), and venue/presenters \(8%\). We like to see industry closer to 20%, but this is nearly there. Increasing the venue/presenters portion slightly to support the creatives may bring more balance. )
/E (Across the 2,768 respondents, the Cleveland music ecosystem enjoys a healthy balance across creatives \(74%\), industry \(18%\), and venue/presenters \(8%\). We like to see industry closer to 20%, but this is nearly there. Increasing the venue/presenters portion slightly to support the creatives may bring more balance. )
