/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 860 0 R
/ActualText (Spend - Creative respondents annually spend approximately $7,897 on music-related services, with half of this expenditure staying local. Their spending is notably higher than in Austin, where the average is $6,300. Collectively, creative respondents contribute around $29.58 million to the economy each year, with 48% of that amount circulating locally. Significant expenses include recording, which tops the list at $5.16 million, followed closely by promotion and social media, rehearsal and workspace, and supplies, each exceeding $4 million in total spend.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [12]
>>
