/T (Ample Industry: Cleveland has a decent industry segment \(18%\) that is approaching 20% which offers its ecosystem a competitive advantage over places lacking this infrastructure. Growing this segment, incentivizing innovative approaches, and increasing awareness and outreach to local audiences, many of whom provide industry services for themselves \(DIY\), would grow this important segment and keep dollars local, further boosting the music economy in Cleveland. )
