/P 898 0 R
/ActualText (Music Hubs - virtual and physical space: A series of smaller hubs utilizing existing spaces, such as venues and other cultural and creative spaces. These hubs would provide a nexus for music services, collaboration among musicians, and connections with other creative sectors. They could also offer essential resources like affordable rehearsal areas, professional training, and studio space/equipment for content creation. Additionally, these hubs would serve as venues for both virtual and in-person networking, supporting the community's desire for a versatile and accessible musical environment.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
