/P 899 0 R
/ActualText (Mentorship: With so many people with 10+ years experience, and older folks experiencing elitism/ageism, mentorship initiatives could plug in the experience across the ecosystem in a meaningful way. If this were implemented across different sectors, there could be opportunities to convert the DIY into doing it together. )
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [5]
>>
